Action Input: {"smiles": "C1CCC(=O)C(=CC1)CCC#N"}

Thought: The SMILES string "C1CCC(=O)C(=CC1)CCC#N" is valid. I will now search for this SMILES in the NMRShift database to find relevant NMR data, which might help confirm if this is the correct structure.
